review:
Return to Castle Wolfenstein - is awesome old school FPS with fast paced gameplay and satisfying gunplay. Game can be easily run on modern machine, just install [url=http://www.markshan.com/knightmare/downloads.htm] Unofficial Patch by Knightmare [/url].

Pros:
- variety of everything (enemies, missions, locations, ect);
- graphics still holds up;
- awesome arsenal;
- fun stealth, for 2001;
- gunplay;
- unofficial addons and mods;

Cons:
- some fights are ridiculously hard, even on normal difficulty;
